    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/4c63984735303643e3cb687d4f1b0a61.avif?t=1744559294\" data-has-big width=800 height=286 /></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight your way up the Tinkerer's tower, facing dangers as he tries to stop you, discover new abilities, and loot as you ascend to the top.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tower Runner is a medieval-themed, infinite runner. Dive deep into the tower's lore, why it is here, how it is still standing, and who is its master.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/5f699bb3072c8f85325ac67ae936598b.avif?t=1744559294\" data-has-big width=800 height=448 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/7c2916b09ab11a8ab7f254fc052b1e1b.avif?t=1744559294\" data-has-big width=800 height=286 /></span></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An upward infinite runner.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use powerful spells to destroy incoming traps.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3538720/extras/18779676f07263eb791b770c1bdf9c57.avif?t=1744559294\" data-has-big width=800 height=482 /></span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover the lore behind the tower's existence.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find powerful new abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore an intuitive game design,</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >And try to go higher and higher every time</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span cl